      "name": "What are account engagement signals and why are they important for B2B marketers?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Account engagement signals are data points reflecting an individual's interaction with your brand, content, or related topics. These signals are vital because they shift marketing from broad outreach to precise, intent-driven actions. By understanding what specific buyers within a target account are doing, marketers can deliver timely, personalized experiences that resonate. This granular insight prevents wasted effort and accelerates the sales cycle, directly impacting pipeline generation and revenue."
